<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχά̆ν-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, = foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>machine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; <i>mechanical device</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				848a36
			</span></i>; esp. <i>engine of war</i>, used in sieges, mostly in pl.,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.48.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>subtle contrivance</i>, freq. in Trag., as <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				469
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				989
			</span></i>; of the robe in which Agamemnon was entangled, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				981
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγου μ. ποικίλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					762
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Ἥρας μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					855
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδενὶ μηχανήματιοὐδ᾽ ἀπάτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὸς τοὺς πολεμίους μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.38
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ μέγεθος τῆς
			ἀρχῆς</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				8.6.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. εἰς τὸ πείθεσθαι τοῖς νόμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					8.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖ μηχανήματός τινος ὅπως τὰ . .
					χρήμαθ᾽ ἕξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					872
				</span></i>
			.</div>
